OL,3,GNEWSABakery owner calls for Budget help
OL,4,Afor firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a bakery in Manchester has
OL,7,Furged Prime Minister Andy Burnham to
OL,8,Fgive the hospitality industry a
OL,9,F'fighting chance' as it struggles to
OL,10,Fkeep up with increasing prices.
OL,12,FBarbakan Deli is an artisan bakery and
OL,13,Fdeli in Chorlton that has been at the
OL,14,Fheart of the community for the last 62
OL,15,Fyears. However, it is struggling to
OL,16,Fkeep up with its bills, despite turning
OL,17,Fover more than #2.3m a year.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
