OL,3,GNEWSABakery owner calls for Budget help
OL,4,Afor firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an open letter to the prime
OL,7,Fminister, owner Frankie Dyer said there
OL,8,Fis "nowhere left to squeeze" and asked
OL,9,Ffor independent businesses to be
OL,10,Fconsidered in the upcoming Budget.
OL,12,FA Treasury spokesperson said decisions
OL,13,Fon tax are "a matter for the Chancellor
OL,14,Fto set out at fiscal events".
